// HZM coop - SEVERITY-TIERED PLAYER PAIN. GENERATED by docs/tools/gen_pain_tiers.py.
// DO NOT EDIT BY HAND - re-run the generator; it reads the take list out of coop_pain.scr
// so the tiers can never drift from the pool they are built on.
//
// Every tier carries ALL 11 takes, rendered at a different volume and pitch. The takes are
// one actor, all peak-normalised, so they cannot be SORTED by intensity - but they can be
// PLAYED differently, and that is what makes a graze and a mortal hit sound different.
//
// Prefixes deliberately do NOT begin with player_pain: Sound() matches by PREFIX, so such a
// name would also be drawn by Sound("player_pain") and would pollute the base pool. No bare
// "coop_hurt" alias is defined either, so nothing can draw ACROSS tiers.
//
// Selected by Player::Pain from the damage it already has in scope; thresholds are
// coop_painTierLo / coop_painTierHi, as a PERCENT of max_health so they follow coop_health.

// ---- coop_hurtlt ----
